  m_text: '(Speaking of the Wau Bulan, there is an old legend. In ancient times,
    a prince

    named Dewa Muda used the kite framework as a map of his conquered

    lands.
    As his territory expanded, the kite patterns grew more elaborate! We

    also
    associate these kites with the ''rice spirit'' to bring abundant crops.)'
